An action that sends a permission question to a parent or guardian.

Use the ``EnvironmentValues/askPermission`` environment value to get an
instance of this action, then call the instance to send a permission
question. You can call the instance directly because it defines a
``callAsFunction(_:)`` method.

For example:

```swift
struct MyView: View {
    @Environment(\.askPermission) private var askPermission

    var body: some View {
        Button("Ask Permission") {
            try await askPermission(question)
        }
    }
}
```
